<p>We thank Leslie Gregg-Jolly, Grinnell College undergraduates Robin Lindemann, Ruth Emrick, Jessica Schmidt, Erin Schmidt, Paul Duffin, Felicia Barriga, and Lilliana Radoshevich, and Colorado College undergraduates Yuliya Muratov, Sarah Stanley, and Lucille Wenegieme.</p></section><section id="fn-group1" class="fn-group"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Footnotes</h2>
